        <item>
        <title>Songs in the Key of Mike</title>
        <link>http://localhost:1313/thesneers/songs-in-the-key-of-mike/</link>
        <pubDate>Sun, 19 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
        <author>info@thesneers.com (The Sneers)</author>
        <guid>http://localhost:1313/thesneers/songs-in-the-key-of-mike/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="http://localhost:1313/2.jpeg" alt="Featured image of post Songs in the Key of Mike" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our new EP is out! “Songs in the Key of Mike” is available on all streams, including Bandcamp and Spotify. Produced by John Angelo. Artwork by Andrew Burgess. Dedicated to our man, Michael McMahon Jr., who after the recording of this record moved on to pursue new adventures. Mike had been with us since the band’s inception. He’s an awesome human and we wish him the best in all endeavors. This EP rips! Please check it out! Track list includes: ‘Fuck These Fucking Nazis,’ ‘Katy Perry,’ ‘Tool Bag,’ and ‘Whip’ (revisited). Soon to be released in physical format too from 1120 Records. Stay tuned!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
        </item>
        <item>
        <title>About Us</title>
        <link>http://localhost:1313/thesneers/about-us/</link>
        <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
        <author>info@thesneers.com (The Sneers)</author>
        <guid>http://localhost:1313/thesneers/about-us/</guid>
        <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/thesneers/6.jpg&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sneers are a punk band from Buffalo NY. We infuse a unique blend of influences mixing elements of both hardcore and
jam to  create a tight yet free-flowing and unique sound set against a landscape of words and stories that exude the
Rust Belt&amp;rsquo;s rawness, dark humor, restlessness and angst.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
        </item>
